	(text "Passive AT-cut fundamental crystal + internal DCXO. No supply pin.\nInternal load tuning: no external load capacitors fitted.\n40 MHz is within the 19-50 MHz crystal range.\nMPN, ESR, drive rating, tolerance and footprint remain TBD.\nPlace beside U1; short symmetric traces; calibrate DCXO."
