	(text "SYNC_IN defaults low; CTRL_IN[3:0] have reference pull-downs. Optional future 1.8 V control.\nENABLE / TXNRX / EN_AGC host drivers and startup behavior remain TBD; select ENSM mode in firmware.\nCMOS thresholds at 1.8 V: VIH >= 1.44 V; VIL <= 0.36 V (AD9361 Rev.G p.7).\nExternal power sources and Zynq are not implemented. Global labels are logical nets, not drivers.\nCrystal circuit: FMCOMMS3 Rev.A sheet2; digital pulls / termination: sheet3. Not production ready."
